Argo CD with Helm Charts
Lab Objectives
By the end of this lab, you will be able to:

Install and configure Helm package manager in a Kubernetes cluster
Set up Argo CD for GitOps-based application deployment
Create and deploy applications using Helm charts through Argo CD
Understand the integration between Helm and Argo CD for continuous deployment
Manage application lifecycle using GitOps principles with Helm charts
Prerequisites
Before starting this lab, you should have:

Basic understanding of Kubernetes concepts (pods, services, deployments)
Familiarity with YAML configuration files
Basic knowledge of Git version control
Understanding of containerization concepts
Experience with command-line interface operations
