The GitOps approach you've learned enables:

Declarative configuration management through Git
Automated deployment pipelines without manual intervention
Version control for all infrastructure and application changes
Easy rollbacks to previous working states
Audit trails of all changes through Git history
These skills are essential for modern DevOps practices and will help you implement reliable, scalable, and maintainable deployment pipelines in production environments.
